(13, 'M004-PO Labor', 'M004-PO', 'ISD Labor Partner Periode September 2026 - {{company_name}}', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Dear Valued Partners,</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Berikut terlampir ISD\r\nlabor report periode bulan September 2026.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Case-case yang status\r\nnya belum ‘Closed’ dan tidak masuk dalam list file terlampir, akan kami proses\r\ndi bulan berikut nya.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Mohon bisa di crosscheck\r\njuga di masing-masing partner.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Apabila sudah sesuai,\r\nsilahkan dibuat</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">kan invoice dan kirim softcopy invoice nya via email ke :</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif; color: black;\"><a href=\"mailto:finance@harmoniputra.com\">finance@harmoniputra.com</a></span></u><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; up Mba Neysa.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Sehubungan dengan\r\nperjanjian Agreement FY26 terbaru, berikut kami informasikan beberapa hal\r\nterkait tagihan case labor sebagai berikut :</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- Batas waktu penerimaan\r\nsoftcopy &amp; hardcopy dokumen untuk seluruh case adalah 6 bulan setelah\r\nperiode closing.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp; Contoh : Periode\r\nNovember 2025 akan Jatuh Tempo pada 31 Mei 2026 (batas waktu terakhir).</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- Jika ada invoice dan\r\nkelengkapan data (SRF &amp; ERF) yang dikirimkan melebihi dari tanggal batas\r\nwaktu terakhir tersebut, maka invoice tersebut tidak bisa kami proses.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- Jika ada tagihan atau\r\ninvoice yang hangus (melebihi batas waktu terakhir) maka invoice tsb tidak\r\ndapat dicairkan lagi (HANGUS).</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: black; font-family: &quot;Century Gothic&quot;, sans-serif;\">Regards,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Thony</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Master Hub Center&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>', 'apo', '2026-08-04 06:43:36', '2026-10-13 03:56:21'),
(14, 'M003-Pembayaran', 'M003-PAY1', 'PEMBAYARAN LABOR SERVICE PARTNER CLOSING {{subject}} - {{company_name}}', '<p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Dear Partners,</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Kami informasikan sudah terbayarnya pencairan labor sebagai berikut. Mohon untuk crosscheck :</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">[[TABEL_PEMBAYARAN]]</font></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note :</span><br><font color=\"#000000\">- Payment term / jatuh tempo pembayaran invoice labor adalah 95 hari setelah<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> invoice dan kelengkapan dokumen (scan SRF+ERF) kami terima via email (soft copy).</span></font><br><font color=\"#000000\">- Untuk hard copy invoice dapat dikirimkan melalui jasa ekspedisi kepada kami &amp; dapat digabungkan beberapa bulan untuk hard copy invoice.</font><br><font color=\"#000000\">- Hardcopy invoice dapat dikirimkan ke alamat :</font></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><i>PT. Harmoni Putra Solusindo</i><br><i>Jl. MT. Haryono No. 427-429</i><br><i>Ruko Mataram Plaza Blok D7</i><br><i>Semarang 50136</i><br><i>Telp. 024 – 3560077</i><br><i>Up. Neysa/Finance</i></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><i><br></i></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Terima kasih,<br>Salam,<br>Neysa<br>Finance PT Harmoni Putra Solusindo</p>', 'finance', '2026-08-04 07:39:15', '2026-10-14 08:01:59'),
(15, 'M001-MPR', 'M001-MPR1', 'MPR - {{tanggal_kirim}} {{company_name}}', '<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Dear Team,</p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Berikut kami berikan hasil dari Monthly Performance Review periode bulan <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">{{tanggal_kirim}}</span> untuk <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">{{company_name}}</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">[[TABEL_MPR]]<br><br></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Regards,<br>Vira<br>Master Hub Center<br><br><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjs9YUvQxCD2GsPvHN-IDTPOS3MzmqsvhspEUlJOL7Gzu5hHyQceyN8tPzsPTsupiQVO-udzfyLGgcbw-7jLxNUHT9BnUyVcM9ue0EP0wIS6ZJi2_7YlSm8rjDqJeXohl7a7UPbzOTsvKDSKaJuRV3CunRFq0pHze510iUqYl2rQijkYzD5b3DFX_qWO3eQ/s1600/apo2.png\" width=\"85\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Logo Master Hub Center\" style=\"display: block; border: 0px;\"></p>', 'apo2', '2026-08-04 08:15:53', '2026-10-13 03:55:59');
